<title>USA: Equity Office offering nets $564.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Equity Office offering nets $564.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Office Properties Trust said Friday its net proceeds from its initial public offering of 28.8 million common shares were $564.5 million.</p>
<p>The office building company, headed by financier Samuel Zell, will use the proceeds to pay down debt, the company said.</p>
<p>Equity Office shares were up 2/16 at 26-3/16 Friday. The shares were priced at $21 earlier this week.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
